# X6 pixel font: original glyph artwork for this project.
# Each glyph: a "[c]" header line, then 7 rows (cap height) and optionally
# 2 descender rows. '#' is ink, '.' is blank. All rows in a glyph share a width.
# tools/gen_font.py turns this file into src/ui/font_data.c.

